.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH dkp-fix 1  "fix 0.4.0" 
.SH NAME
dkp\-fix \- Failure\-aware chunk regeneration using eval results
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBdkp fix\fR [\fB\-\-api\-key\fR] [\fB\-\-output\fR] [\fB\-\-base\-url\fR] [\fB\-q\fR|\fB\-\-quiet\fR] [\fB\-\-model\fR] [\fB\-v\fR|\fB\-\-verbose\fR] [\fB\-\-audience\fR] [\fB\-\-no\-tools\fR] [\fB\-\-no\-render\-formats\fR] [\fB\-\-instructions\fR] [\fB\-\-max\-tool\-turns\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] [\fB\-V\fR|\fB\-\-version\fR] <\fIPACK\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Failure\-aware chunk regeneration using eval results
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-api\-key\fR \fI<KEY>\fR

.TP
\fB\-\-output\fR \fI<OUTPUT>\fR [default: plain]
Output format
.br

.br
\fIPossible values:\fR
.RS 14
.IP \(bu 2
plain: Human\-readable plain text (default)
.IP \(bu 2
table: Aligned table using comfy\-table
.IP \(bu 2
json: Pretty\-printed JSON
.RE
.TP
\fB\-\-base\-url\fR \fI<URL>\fR

.TP
\fB\-q\fR, \fB\-\-quiet\fR
Suppress informational output; print only results
.TP
\fB\-\-model\fR \fI<MODEL>\fR

.TP
\fB\-v\fR, \fB\-\-verbose\fR
Print debug info (schema paths, provider calls, etc.)
.TP
\fB\-\-audience\fR \fI<ID>\fR
Filter content to assets tagged for a specific audience profile
.TP
\fB\-\-no\-tools\fR
Disable web_fetch/web_search tool use (on by default)
.TP
\fB\-\-no\-render\-formats\fR
Skip rendering human/handbook.md to handbook.pdf/handbook.epub (on by default)
.TP
\fB\-\-instructions\fR \fI<TEXT>\fR
Extra free\-text guidance appended to every generation prompt (e.g. tone, focus areas, things to emphasize or avoid)
.TP
\fB\-\-max\-tool\-turns\fR \fI<N>\fR
Max tool round\-trips per generation call before giving up (default: 6)
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help (see a summary with \*(Aq\-h\*(Aq)
.TP
\fB\-V\fR, \fB\-\-version\fR
Print version
.TP
<\fIPACK\fR>
Path to the DKP pack directory
.SH VERSION
v0.4.0
